From c7ecc08db9623c19dd76feee9f563c5ae453bbb5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:22:52 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] A heal on a friend floats green over their head

SMSG_SPELLHEALLOG from me or my pet onto someone else spawns a green number over them (a crit pops), as later WoW does; 1.12 floats no heal. HasActionCombat() is 28 so the server sends the log only to this client.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---

diff --git a/crates/benilla-app/src/combat_log/mod.rs b/crates/benilla-app/src/combat_log/mod.rs
